# Lunar Ice Detection project setup

This repository now includes a small synthetic DFSAR-style sample dataset for prototyping.

Files added:
- `data/dfsar/README.md` — explains the sample dataset and limitations
- `data/dfsar/sample_dfsar_radar.csv` — synthetic radar + terrain feature samples
- `data/dfsar/generate_sample_dfsar.py` — script to regenerate the sample CSV

Use this dataset to:
- test the data pipeline,
- run preliminary machine learning models,
- build a working prototype before using the official DFSAR data.

For real mission-grade work, replace this with official DFSAR or mission product files.
